# Copy to `.dev.vars` before your first `pnpm dev`. Gitignored.
#
# ⚠️ ENVIRONMENT=development unlocks the dev lanes — the mock mailer that logs
# OTP codes to the console, and the platform-admin convenience. It must NEVER
# reach wrangler.jsonc's `vars` block: in production it would put sign-in codes
# in retained logs and accept the repo-public auth-secret fallback.
ENVIRONMENT=development

# openssl rand -base64 32 — a wrangler secret in production.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=dev-only-not-a-real-secret-000000000000
